	(text "VCC: SS110 100V series block + SMAJ58A tail-risk TVS (REQ-HUB-COMMON-110).\nDETECT: 10k series R [BOM names 1206 pkg, captured as 0402 -- flagged] -> PESD5V0S1BA (LOCKED Sec2.4) + 10k pull-up to +3V3 (Sec2.3 code read).\npin-7: 100R series R [illustrative] + SMAJ58A tail-risk clamp (REQ-HUB-COMMON-112/114).\nAll pin-7/DETECT-series values are a schematic-capture/bench-calibration task per hub-ent-bom-detailed Sec6a, not bench-verified here."
